  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing kills Chen Cui Hua. Fang Yuan uses Plunder Gu and retrieves three aperture Gu, including Rice Bag Grass Gu, Iron Thorn Thistle Gu, and a charred thunder bean mother Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_chen_cui_hua",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_plunder_gu",
          "gu_iron_thorn_thistle_gu",
          "gu_charred_thunder_potato_mother_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the cave after they eat grass-skirt monkey brain and grill the meat, Fang Yuan wills Rice Bag Grass. Green light shoots from his aperture, buds rise from the ground, and in a few breaths the growth becomes vines and bucket-shaped leaves that hold large plump white rice kernels, which Bai Ning Bing eats with the monkey meat.",
        "chapters": [
          212
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_green"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that after they killed the heavily injured demonic female Gu Master, taking her Gu, including rice bag Gu and Jumping Grass Gu, was what let them barely get by on the road.",
        "chapters": [
          214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "road-loot-recall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "gu_jumping_grass_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At an old lady’s house, the rice they eat is rough grain, not the superior rice from rice bag grass.",
        "chapters": [
          231
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ordinary-rice-contrast",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Inventorying his aperture, he places the charred thunder potato mother Gu and a rice bag Gu close together among his Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aperture-inventory",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
